Package: code-server
Version: 4.145.2
Architecture: amd64
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Maintainer: ericbyz <ericbyz@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: systemd
Description: VS Code in the browser (code-server) for TOS
 Run VS Code on the TNAS and access it from any browser on the LAN.
 Packages upstream coder/code-server (self-contained, bundles its own
 Node runtime) with a preconfigured service on port 18225 and
 password authentication; the generated password is printed at
 install time and stored in /etc/code-server/config.yaml.
 Upstream project: https://github.com/coder/code-server (MIT).
